  "subject": "Disposition on the 2026-06-03-2130 + 2026-06-03-2330 cross-spec canonicalization ask — CA-018 filed accepting the narrowed 2-var ask (.x-subtitle → .subtitle; .x-quick_filters → items in .views reserved subcat) + ratifying the catalog-vs-application framing as catdef-canonical guidance for future promotion decisions; 3 chrome vars confirmed permanent .x- per the framing; §2.2 unification withdrawal concurred; filter grammar deferred to its own cycle; v1.5 cycle activation surfaced for Director (CA-018 recommends Path A, bundled v1.5; Director's call); standard pipeline from here (maintainer drafts proposals + conformance tests; Director ratifies; spec text merges); no urgency change",

  "sent": "2026-06-04T10:00:00-04:00",
